{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125144540084-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125153206\"/><p>警員到場調查。(陳嘉傑攝)</p><p>大埔發生劫案。今午(25日)1時46分，富善邨善美樓一名男子報案，指他遭一名男賊尾隨入屋打劫，失去一條金鏈、一隻金戒指、一隻金手鐲、一部手機、銀包及兩萬港元現金。警員接報趕至，立刻在附近一帶兜截，惟未見劫匪蹤影，遂翻查大廈地下大堂閉路電視錄影，追緝劫匪歸案。事主反抗時手腳受傷，由救護車送往那打素醫院治療。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:43:58.044307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:45:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:17:13.599764+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:37:23.692048+00:00","content_hash":"90be0c28b33479807d35a2f7bfc82278410981100edfeabfdd74c5ee6c81f99b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:43:58.044307+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}